   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: try LFA first; tunnel only if no neighbor is safe",
   "originalText": "The rule: try LFA first; tunnel only if no neighbor is safe",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b13-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 740,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "best LFA exists for (S, D, S–E)   →  use it;  Remote LFA not needed\nno LFA                            →  tunnel to the best PQ node (B11), if any",
   "originalText": "best LFA exists for (S, D, S–E)   →  use it;  Remote LFA not needed\nno LFA                            →  tunnel to the best PQ node (B11), if any",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b13-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 216,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 128,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  An LFA is just another next hop: no tunnel, no extra label, nothing the far end has to understand. A\n   Remote LFA tunnel needs an extra label, and the repair path is often longer.\n•  RFC 7490 extends LFA: it adds backups \"when none can be provided by the basic mechanisms\" (RFC\n   5286).\n•  P, Q and PQ are still worked out and shown on every row, for teaching. The detail panel says \"Remote\n   LFA not needed\".",
   "originalText": "•  An LFA is just another next hop: no tunnel, no extra label, nothing the far end has to understand. A\n   Remote LFA tunnel needs an extra label, and the repair path is often longer.\n•  RFC 7490 extends LFA: it adds backups \"when none can be provided by the basic mechanisms\" (RFC\n   5286).\n•  P, Q and PQ are still worked out and shown on every row, for teaching. The detail panel says \"Remote\n   LFA not needed\".",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b13-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 354,
   "width": 479,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
